BIRD's configuration (arcana-bird), the host's and each running vnet
jail's, a file at a time: its main file
.Pq Fl a
or a
.Pa .conf
beside it, the one before kept as
.Pa .arcana-old ,
the whole parsed by
.Xr bird 8
.Fl p
first, then
.Ql birdc configure ;
by a confirmed commit
.Ql configure timeout ,
BIRD's own timer five seconds longer than the commit's, then
.Ql configure confirm
once the commit is confirmed, or
.Ql configure undo
and the file put back when it is undone;
