.Pq Pa sdwan-rules.json , sdwan-steer.json , sdwan-bird.json , No and their Pa @ Ns Ar jail No files, Pa sdwan-dhcp.json , sdwan-dns.json , sdwan-proxy.json , security-proxy.json , sdwan-ids.json , security-ids.json ;
a part that fails puts back those set before it in the same edit.
The node's
.Ic apply
action sets a part again as it is, which starts what of it is not
running;
